      "content": "That's definitely more vivid! The imagery with the sunlight on the marble is nice.\n\nI'm seeing the richness score climb, which is moving in the right direction for my reporting. But honestly, looking at the latest draft, it's still feeling a little bit \"lean\" for a property of this caliber. I really want this to feel like an overwhelming sensory experience—like the adjectives themselves are part of the luxury.\n\nCan you try one more version? Really lean into the descriptive side. I want the adjectives to be as lush and expansive as the villa itself. I know I said don't overdo it, but I really need that richness score to hit a higher tier for the final presentation to the client. Just make sure it still reads like a high-end brochure!",
